# What codex.playdfmc.com does NOT serve (wrangler reads this at the assets root; tools/deploy_codex.sh archives
# it into _site/ with the tree). The same filter the GitHub Pages workflow applies, plus the repo plumbing
# nobody links to. gitignore syntax: `floors/ground_plates/*.png` is the png masters only - the 1080/*.webp
# set the pages load stays.
.git
.github
.claude
.wrangler
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
_parking
# workflow/: the dev/workflow pages (GDD, dev dashboard, review tools, networking/integrity/shell notes) - never public (D 2026-11-03)
workflow
_site
archive
tools
scripts
__pycache__
codex/images/originals
floors/ground_plates/*.png
*.py
/*.md
